      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That makes sense. It sounds like the movement was pretty much the main reason we have the stability we have today. Were there any major arguments against it at the time, or was it pretty much just a fight between workers and greedy corporations?",
      "source": "evaluator"
